  CardStory: "The debriefs are turning to interrogations. Spades2 knows it will all
    get worse, before it gets better. It\u2019s always like this. The Order is pragmatic
    before all else. Or at least it used to be. Now paranoia is rampant, accusations
    among soldiers are turning the once tight hierarchy of the Order into a witch
    hunt.\r\n\r\nSpades 2 thinks about his own meeting with the Sergeant. Maybe her
    eyes were too big after all. The spikes frustrate me. They are opaque, hard to
    read. So are the strings that the Clubs wield.\n\r\nSomeone has been entering
    the barracks at night. But of course. That\u2019s where soldiers go to lay still
    when there is no light outside. Someone has been opening locked doors. Well,
    how else will soldiers pass through them?"
